    <rigor>MINIMAL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Read-only Phase-0 verification of operator-created schema — no schema mutation, no BFF code, no Step 9.5 gates. MINIMAL per §8 (verification/inventory). It grounds the identifier rung (020) roster + gates Job B (Phase 3, `sprk_emailupdatefield`); getting the live delta or typo map wrong cascades into a wrong rung, but the task itself changes nothing.</rigor-reason>
    <parallel-group>P0</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Mechanical live-schema read + note authoring; no architectural judgment or code generation. Default execution tier at the lowest effort suffices.</model-tier-reason>
