      <pattern name="Dataverse MCP live-schema read" location=".claude/skills/dataverse-mcp-usage/SKILL.md">
        Use the built-in MCP read tools (`describe`, `read_query`, `search`) to enumerate an entity's live attributes + a table's rows before any dependent task builds. Read-only; no mutation.
      </pattern>
